      ],
      "en": "By the rivers of Babylon, there we sat down. Yes, we wept, when we remembered Zion.",
      "ko": "우리가 바벨론의 여러 강변 거기 앉아서 시온을 기억하며 울었도다",
      "source_text_hash": "b2e1c4412a3abb2ff8901e8d4776e38c77208b0165ade2ff83ca7c1e24db3041",
      "translation_text_hash": "7213eafda100d65a4f8763af12a7a1e63309e31153b96e8503bccf78a2cf41aa",
